<title>FRANCE: Record 1.5 tonne cannabis seized in France.</title>
<headline>Record 1.5 tonne cannabis seized in France.</headline>
<dateline>BORDEAUX, France 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A record 1.5 tonnes of cannabis resin was seized concealed among detergents in a large truck crossing from Spain into France near the Atlantic coast resort of Biarritz on Friday, French customs said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The driver,a 47-year-old resident of Malaga, Spain, and another man with him were both arrested, the agents said.</p>
